Subject: [PATCH 184/202] [ae-patch] Show only the name on a family's lead row
 and archive its sessions with it

In Grouping > Family a lead row now shows its name and a bare fold chevron. The family's cost pill and session count pill covered the name on a narrow panel and sat under the pin on hover; the count and open count move to the hover card's lead line, beside the family total that already follows Spend shows.

Archiving a lead archives every session under it. When all of them are in the family's closed group it archives at once; otherwise a confirm asks first and Cancel archives nothing.
